part records
  tally 2
  note "The balances read from the record files whose rows no question reads one by one: the Wektor registers (units after each purchase) and the Lazur export (balance after each row). Each is a reading of the place's balance (L §5.19) with the version anchoring it; the rows before it are not imported, so these places' balances before a reading are what is booked on them, and the readings restart them. Each states the reading's parts once (L §5.19), from the story's column whose: all community. Ania's savings export is booked row by row, its last balance read again. The joint account's statements, the Brzask register and the Rzeka and DM Kopia registers are observations (statements/statements.tally)."

input abank: observed
  note "Rzeka Securities, client 4471-07, Anna Lis: the register's rows (rzk-4471-07-anna.csv)"

input jbank: observed
  note "Bank Wrzos, the joint account LN27 … 0412: the statements' rows, 2024-08 to 2025-12 (wrz-joint-*.csv)"

input kbank: observed
  note "DM Kopia, account 30-118-552, Anna Lis: the register's rows (kop-30-118-552-ania.csv)"

input tbank: observed
  note "Rzeka Securities, client 4471-02, Tomasz Lis: the register's rows (rzk-4471-02-tomasz.csv)"

input sbank: observed
  note "Bank Wrzos, Ania's savings account LN61 … 5503: the export's rows, 2025-06 to 2025-12 (wrz-ania-savings-2025.csv)"

input wbank: observed
  note "Brzask, the wrapped account BRZ-WRAP-0091-A: the register's rows (brz-wrapped-ania.csv)"

